            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Chats now render only their newest ~20k characters of scrollback instead of laying out megabytes of markdown per update — fat sessions stop feeling sluggish on both platforms. Older history stays on the daemon exactly as before.
